    "Calories from the Watch arrive through Apple Health; WHOOP's daily total arrives once WHOOP is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las calorías del Watch llegan a través de Salud; el total diario de WHOOP llega cuando WHOOP está conectado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change from your own baseline (Watch: wrist while asleep · WHOOP: skin).": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cambio respecto a tu propia referencia (Watch: muñeca mientras duermes · WHOOP: piel)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check off your Stack, log workouts or sauna sessions, and keep wearing your trackers. Once there are at least %lld days with and %lld without, comparisons show up here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marca tu Stack, registra entrenamientos o sesiones de sauna y sigue usando tus dispositivos. Cuando haya al menos %lld días con y %lld sin, las comparaciones aparecerán aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Climb": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desnivel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close to your usual. Train as planned, but no need to chase a record.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerca de lo habitual. Entrena según lo previsto, sin perseguir récords."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comparar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare needs both trackers. Connect WHOOP (or turn on WHOOP's Apple Health integration) to start the duel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comparar necesita ambos dispositivos. Conecta WHOOP (o activa la integración de WHOOP con Salud) para empezar el duelo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect Apple Health": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectar la app Salud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
